    // شريط تنقّل أنيق للشاشة القديمة: بطاقة بإطار ملوّن وخلفية مصبوغة بخفّة (بدل شريط أزرق عريض مصمت)
    private void styleNavChip(LinearLayout bar, String colorHex, TextView label) {
        float d = getResources().getDisplayMetrics().density;
        int accent = android.graphics.Color.parseColor(colorHex);
        android.graphics.drawable.GradientDrawable bg = new android.graphics.drawable.GradientDrawable();
        bg.setColor((accent & 0x00FFFFFF) | 0x1E000000);
        bg.setCornerRadius(12 * d);
        bg.setStroke(Math.max(2, (int) (1.4f * d)), accent);
        bar.setBackground(bg);
        bar.setPadding((int) (14 * d), (int) (9 * d), (int) (14 * d), (int) (9 * d));
        if (label != null) {
            label.setTextSize(14);
            label.setTextColor(isDark() ? 0xFFE3F2FD : accent);
        }
    }

    private LinearLayout makeLegacyBar(String arrow, String text, String colorHex, Runnable action) {
        LinearLayout bar = new LinearLayout(this);
        bar.setOrientation(LinearLayout.HORIZONTAL);
        bar.setGravity(android.view.Gravity.CENTER);
        bar.setClickable(true);
        bar.setOnClickListener(v -> action.run());
        TextView tv = new TextView(this);
        tv.setText(arrow + "  " + text);
        tv.setTypeface(null, Typeface.BOLD);
        bar.addView(tv);
        styleNavChip(bar, colorHex, tv);
        return bar;
    }

